      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=119",
      "html": "<p>Etymology: from the Greek brachys, -eia = short, plus the Brazilian vernacular name Nhamdia/Jamdia. The family name Heptapteridae comes from the Greek hepta, meaning seven, and pteron, meaning fin.</p>"
